    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Growing Communities with fruitful planting\nOur vitafusion team believes in holistic wellness and realizes that it's more than just taking good vitamins. That's why we teamed up with the Fruit Tree Planting Foundation to plant 10,000+ fruit trees in underserved communities every year.\nTogether we are committed to producing nutrient-rich fresh fruit, sustainable lifestyles and happy, healthy communities now and for generations to come.\nLearn more about our mission vitafusion.com"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Award winning taste!"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "No artificial flavors or sweeteners\nNo gluten\nNo high fructose corn syrup\nNo dairy\nNo synthetic FD&C dyes"
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "Certified renewable energy\nGreen-e\nManufactured with 100% certified renewable energy"
    },
    {
      "type": "FDA Disclaimer Statement",
      "notes": "These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."
    },
    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Suggested use: As a dietary supplement, adults take two (2) gummy vitamins per day. Chew thoroughly before swallowing."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Allergies",
      "notes": "Contains: Fish (anchovy and/or sardine with mackerel and/or herring)."
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "This product uses high quality, purified fish oil that has been tested for mercury and PCBs."
    },
    {
